      "description": "Imagination is the source of all creation.\nWelcome to Dreamina AI, an AI-powered creative platform designed for innovators and dreamers. We turn your imagination into reality. Whether for daily entertainment or technical exploration, Dreamina AI is the perfect tool to express your ideas.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n- Image Creation: Let your wildest ideas shine. From a whale swimming through the clouds to an astronaut riding a horse, simply describe your vision in words and watch our AI create stunning, high-quality images for you.\n- Poster Perfect: Create designs where text and visuals exist in perfect harmony. Generate eye-catching posters, unique invitations, or social media graphics with stylized text that truly complements your images.\n- Video Creation: Transform words or images into pure cinema. Animate your favorite creations or generate captivating video clips from a simple text prompt. Bring your stories to life with motion.\n- Intelligent Reference: Steer the AI with your own visual style. Use a reference image to guide the composition, color, and overall aesthetic of your generations, ensuring the output is exactly what you envision.\n- Smart Editing: Refine your art with precision. Use powerful AI tools to intelligently edit your creations, create variations on the details, or add and remove elements seamlessly. Perfect every last pixel.\n- Get Inspired: Make your art journey less lonesome. Explore a vibrant community feed to see what other users are creating. Discover new styles, learn from their prompts, and get inspired for your next masterpiece.\n\nDownload Dreamina AI today and unlock a new world of creativity!\n\nTerms of Service: https://dreamina.capcut.com/clause/dreamina-terms-of-service\nPrivacy Policy: https://dreamina.capcut.com/clause/dreamina-privacy-policy\nContact: dreaminaglobal@bytedance.com",
